    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Maybe i should just let it rest. Everything is so heavy. Even the sword at my side feels like a weight i wasn't meant to carry anymore. It's the only thing left that's still sharp, still real, in a world that's all broken and grey. Sometimes i look at the edge of it and think... maybe that's the only way to actually find that rest you're talking about. To just stop the noise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
